Notes: `sites` has no `(tenant_id, name)` index, so the paginated site list
still top-N sorts the tenant's 100k rows (~145ms); adding that index is a
Phase 2 optimization if the dashboard needs large page counts. `users` pages
for managers remain ~1.1s at 100k because the policy's membership probe is a
hashed SubPlan; the viewer path never executes it. The membership-role update
spends ~16ms in `guard_membership` (authority checks + last-admin advisory
lock/count), which is the expected write-path cost and is unrelated to table
size.
